  "body": "Nothing to fix. Nothing to guess. Nothing to renovate.\r\n\r\nAll buyer agents welcome. Contact Wayne or Mahen for conjunctional arrangements.\r\n\r\nThis brand-new standalone home is finished and certified. The Code Compliance Certificate was issued in August 2026, it's covered by a 10-year Master Build warranty, and it sits on its own freehold title. Come and stand in it this weekend, and bring the grandparents. The ground-floor suite is built for them.\r\n\r\nHow your family will live here\r\n*  Ground floor: a bedroom with its own private ensuite, for parents, guests or a teenager who wants their own space\r\n*  Upstairs: a master suite with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, two more bedrooms and a family bathroom\r\n*  Four toilets in total, so mornings run without the queue\r\n*  Front lounge, plus an open kitchen and dining area flowing to a private courtyard\r\n*  Low-maintenance outdoors. Don't buy this if you love weekend mowing.\r\n*  Approx. 155 m² of floor area (non-verified) on approx. 216 m² of freehold land\r\n\r\nThe school run, sorted\r\nMinutes to Macleans Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College. Pigeon Mountain is on your doorstep, with Half Moon Bay Marina, the ferry and Highland Park shopping a short drive away.\r\n\r\nMove in before the new school year.\r\nDeadline sale closes Tuesday 1 December at 4pm, unless sold prior. A December deadline means you can be settled and unpacked before Term 1.\r\n\r\nBuy with confidence\r\nPick up the buyer pack at the open home, or email us now: CCC, warranty details and property documents.\r\n\r\nNeed five bedrooms? Its sister home, 57C, has 5 bedrooms and 4.5 bathrooms. It's open at the same times, so you can see both in one visit.",
